{"3034430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "All in Flux", "steam_appid": 3034430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/81ccd3bd55581b4650aa95d0629a691c.gif?t=1773387275\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/81ccd3bd55581b4650aa95d0629a691c.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Lukas. My brother and I grew up exploring game worlds when 3D was still new — and I still long for the excitement and surprises we felt back in those days. With my first independently developed title, I want to recreate that feeling for the child in us and for a new generation. I hope you'll like it 🙂</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐟 CAST YOUR LINE AND ENJOY THE SURPRISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All in Flux</strong> is a fishing adventure about discovery, experimentation, and the thrill of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catching the next fish isn't just about casting your line — it's about understanding what it wants. Every fish is procedurally generated with its own unique look, patterns, and appetite. There's no handbook to rely on. Instead, you'll explore the world, search for environmental clues, and experiment with different lures to uncover each fish's preferences. Sometimes it's preparation that makes the difference — and sometimes, it's pure luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/18784eca5014a8141691da8fc04448e7.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/18784eca5014a8141691da8fc04448e7.webm?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/18784eca5014a8141691da8fc04448e7.mp4?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐞 A WORLD YOU CAN TOUCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a physically responsive miniature open world full of secrets and surprises. Swim in otter form, glide through the air, or wield the <strong>Angon</strong> — your trusty grabbing tool that can slap, swing, and even glow in the dark. Use everything at your disposal to navigate the world, find special lures, and mix tasty ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/a2294ba6776cdafe7662ee6a134b3b95.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/a2294ba6776cdafe7662ee6a134b3b95.webm?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/a2294ba6776cdafe7662ee6a134b3b95.mp4?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎣 LURE CRAFTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials to craft your own lures, discover rare components through exploration, or earn special rewards by solving puzzles and completing meaningful tasks that leave a lasting impact on the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/409f1603ebbde2373ac735a7c53bc0d1.webp?t=1773387275\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/409f1603ebbde2373ac735a7c53bc0d1.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=333 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚙️ PLATFORMING &amp; FRESH PUZZLE MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming sections, hidden paths, and environmental challenges shape your journey as you adapt, learn, and chase after the biggest and rarest catches beneath the surface. Solve physics-based puzzles featuring both familiar mechanics and exciting new ones for the curious mind. Take on the challenges — or simply relax, go fishing, go explore. Try things out. Chances are you'll be rewarded 🙂</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/1e46e6a21323d3bfafa9eecebf47919d.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/1e46e6a21323d3bfafa9eecebf47919d.webm?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/1e46e6a21323d3bfafa9eecebf47919d.mp4?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique fish:</strong> Procedurally generated patterns and appetite for every catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physically responsive world:</strong> Move freely, interact with everything — make some waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digitally handcrafted:</strong> Every visual asset drawn and crafted by human hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio from nature:</strong> Field recordings captured in European nature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Novel puzzle mechanics:</strong> Real fluid simulation at the heart of the puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/82ad89c47b2ec5ff020ddc1044722d66.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" width=60 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/82ad89c47b2ec5ff020ddc1044722d66.webm?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/82ad89c47b2ec5ff020ddc1044722d66.mp4?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/81ccd3bd55581b4650aa95d0629a691c.gif?t=1773387275\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/81ccd3bd55581b4650aa95d0629a691c.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Lukas. My brother and I grew up exploring game worlds when 3D was still new — and I still long for the excitement and surprises we felt back in those days. With my first independently developed title, I want to recreate that feeling for the child in us and for a new generation. I hope you'll like it 🙂</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐟 CAST YOUR LINE AND ENJOY THE SURPRISE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All in Flux</strong> is a fishing adventure about discovery, experimentation, and the thrill of the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catching the next fish isn't just about casting your line — it's about understanding what it wants. Every fish is procedurally generated with its own unique look, patterns, and appetite. There's no handbook to rely on. Instead, you'll explore the world, search for environmental clues, and experiment with different lures to uncover each fish's preferences. Sometimes it's preparation that makes the difference — and sometimes, it's pure luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/18784eca5014a8141691da8fc04448e7.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/18784eca5014a8141691da8fc04448e7.webm?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/18784eca5014a8141691da8fc04448e7.mp4?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🐞 A WORLD YOU CAN TOUCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a physically responsive miniature open world full of secrets and surprises. Swim in otter form, glide through the air, or wield the <strong>Angon</strong> — your trusty grabbing tool that can slap, swing, and even glow in the dark. Use everything at your disposal to navigate the world, find special lures, and mix tasty ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/a2294ba6776cdafe7662ee6a134b3b95.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/a2294ba6776cdafe7662ee6a134b3b95.webm?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/a2294ba6776cdafe7662ee6a134b3b95.mp4?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎣 LURE CRAFTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather materials to craft your own lures, discover rare components through exploration, or earn special rewards by solving puzzles and completing meaningful tasks that leave a lasting impact on the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/409f1603ebbde2373ac735a7c53bc0d1.webp?t=1773387275\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/409f1603ebbde2373ac735a7c53bc0d1.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1170 height=333 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>⚙️ PLATFORMING &amp; FRESH PUZZLE MECHANICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platforming sections, hidden paths, and environmental challenges shape your journey as you adapt, learn, and chase after the biggest and rarest catches beneath the surface. Solve physics-based puzzles featuring both familiar mechanics and exciting new ones for the curious mind. Take on the challenges — or simply relax, go fishing, go explore. Try things out. Chances are you'll be rewarded 🙂</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/1e46e6a21323d3bfafa9eecebf47919d.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" width=1170 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/1e46e6a21323d3bfafa9eecebf47919d.webm?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/1e46e6a21323d3bfafa9eecebf47919d.mp4?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique fish:</strong> Procedurally generated patterns and appetite for every catch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physically responsive world:</strong> Move freely, interact with everything — make some waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digitally handcrafted:</strong> Every visual asset drawn and crafted by human hands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Audio from nature:</strong> Field recordings captured in European nature</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Novel puzzle mechanics:</strong> Real fluid simulation at the heart of the puzzles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/82ad89c47b2ec5ff020ddc1044722d66.poster.avif?t=1773387275\" width=60 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/82ad89c47b2ec5ff020ddc1044722d66.webm?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3034430/extras/82ad89c47b2ec5ff020ddc1044722d66.mp4?t=1773387275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Where did all this slime come from? Fish around and find out as you swim the waters in your otter form, solve ancient puzzles woven into the world, mix tasty ingredients and catch insects to discover special lures to reel in the ultimate catch waiting beneath the surface.", "supported_languages": "English, German, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a